== Textbook

- *Convex Optimization* by Stephen Boyd and Lieven Vandenberghe.
- *Linear Programming: Foundations and Extensions* by Robert J. Vanderbei.
- Convex Optimization video lectures from Stanford and CMU.
- Research papers.